A schema that declares a hidden field and a hidden definition. Either would
make the version's ID depend on how the lineage is loaded (#250), so every
path refuses both, with the same diagnostics.
#ids: refused
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	_limit: 10
	count:  int & <=_limit
	_#Name: string
	name:   _#Name
}
-- out/verdict --
# bind
E0151 the schema of v0.0 declares _limit, a hidden field
E0151 the schema of v0.0 declares _#Name, a hidden definition
